{"segs": ["PA_ja_191:1.1", "PA_ja_191:1.2"], "en": "“O Ruhaka, even though it is cut, the bowstring is joined together again.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_191:1.3"], "en": "Reconcile yourself with the old [friend];", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_191:1.4"], "en": "do not fall under the power of anger.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_191:2.1"], "en": "While there are still words [to be spoken],...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_191:2.2"], "en": "\"While there are craftsmen available,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_191:2.3"], "en": "I shall have another bowstring made;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_191:2.4"], "en": "it is quite enough with this old one.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
